low fibrofatty tissue with a localizing needle in place  a short suture designating the superior margin  and a long suture designating the deep margin  The specimen is inked as follows  superior blue  inferior black  medial green  lateral yellow  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal firm white fibrous tissue admixed with a scant amount of unremarkable yellow adipose tissue  The specimen is submitted in its entirety in from anterior to posterior in cassettes A G and L  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast inferior margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm portion of tan pink to yellow fibrofatty tissue with a suture on one aspect designating the side away from the tumor  The sutured aspect is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassettes H I  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left breast final lateral margin  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm portion of tan pink to yellow fibrofatty tissue with a suture designating the side away from the tumor  The sutured aspect is inked black and the specimen is serially sectioned and submitted in its entirety in cassettes J K  Gross Description by  BETH A  WOODWARD Resident  DAVID COON  PhD  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST LEFT INFERIOR MARGIN  EXCISION PART C  BREAST LEFT LATERAL MARGIN  EXCISION , Absent.
